      "google_reviews_json": "{\"place_id\":\"ChIJGV-_vdfTwkcRX88cSrHGyf8\",\"rating\":4.5,\"user_rating_count\":146,\"google_maps_uri\":\"https://maps.google.com/?cid=18431481414745378655\",\"fetched_at\":\"2026-11-12T19:19:34+01:00\",\"reviews\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-11-08T20:38:34+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a moins d'une semaine\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"jean jerome dubus\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113810984337812451910/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKqXnk2tQKDnEa1eOFbDSR7Ev0ufhwlmbjQTqLy8WTuGD3-qg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-08T06:41:55+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Olivier M\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115947564642856941320/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJZJq4TKi3BwQykvySP5skpuc3N7s1PEJjuwoNiqQF59VWq7g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":4,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-04T06:24:49+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Laurence Dupont\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115113393720451886500/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJmRZHA6Ms008c4EbpLZa327jXMPJoxBOGJRxTUaNyQXzPLBQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"J'y ai organisé l'anniversaire surprise de mon époux il y a quelques jours. Les gérants sont à l'écoute, le cocktail dînatoire est délicieux et le lieu est magnifique. Nous avons tous passé une soirée inoubliable. Merci beaucoup\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-01T17:16:51+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Marie Ledru Mathieu\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103268390568845375503/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPGR7uJj3dMAcOD8V4jVuj27EF9X0ueSo8MiXhRu1Hdd9OkOZE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Un simple mot:\\nExceptionnel !\\nAccueil, organisation, équipe efficace et très agréable.\\nNous avons fêté notre Pacs dans cet havre de paix…\\nUn grand merci à Etienne, Julie, Thibault et surtout Margaux et son équipe qui a su gérer l’ensemble des convives jusqu’à 3h du matin.\\nÀ très bientôt au restaurant !\\nFabien et Isabelle.\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-09-15T15:46:51+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Fabien Denis\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105284493606234013763/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIOWEAfvsQLHt5Ip1lPLTvtTKeLOiMNxccQYqvNF2B4gG6PZg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"}]}",
